OL,3,GNEWSAPolice searching for missing woman
OL,4,Afind body
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice searching for a woman who has
OL,7,Fbeen missing for more than two weeks
OL,8,Fhave found a body.
OL,10,FEren Wright, 29, was last seen at about
OL,11,F10:00 GMT on 27 October on St David's
OL,12,FRoad South in Lytham St Annes.
OL,14,FLancashire Police said search teams
OL,15,Ffound the body in marshland off the
OL,16,Fcoast between Lytham and Warton at
OL,17,Fabout 15:30 GMT on Thursday.
OL,19,FA force spokesperson said: "Whilst
OL,20,Fformal identification has not yet taken
OL,21,Fplace, we do believe it to be Eren."
